d_\mathrm{dcv/pcv} (x,z; x', z')
  &= d_{\pm} (x,z; x',z') - h(x) + h(x') + \inprod{\nabla h(x')}{x-x'} \\
&\geq \frac{1-\tau L-\delta_1}{\tau} d_\primal (x,x^\prime) +
