\end{align*}
With $\delta_1=1-\tau L$ and $\delta_2=1$, this shows convexity of
$\phi_\mathrm{pcv}$ and $\phi_\mathrm{dcv}$;
with $\delta_1=\delta-\tau L$ and $\delta_2=\delta < 1$,
strong convexity.
\end{proof}

